This package contains the inference implementations used by Table 3 of the
FocusMoE paper: SM3Det, FocusMoE, Multi-Branch and Multi-Stage, with a reduced,
modified MMRotate runtime. MMRotate, MMCV and MMDetection are OpenMMLab projects.
The bundled LICENSE retains the Apache License 2.0 text from the original
runtime. Existing source copyright notices are preserved. External dependencies
and checkpoints retain their respective licenses.

The runtime provides the tri-source detector, matching expert-routing modules
and modality-specific preprocessing. Sixteen self-contained inference configs
load final detector checkpoints. Export preserves all model tensor values.
